OL,3,GNEWSAItems recovered in search for
OL,4,Amissing fishing boat and crew
OL,5,
OL,6,FItems belonging to a fishing boat that
OL,7,Fvanished off the north coast of the
OL,8,FIsle of Lewis last week have been
OL,9,Frecovered as the search for the vessel
OL,10,Fand two missing crew members continues.
OL,12,FNorman "Tam" Murray, 40 and Murdo
OL,13,FMorrison, 23, were on board the Kilda
OL,14,Fwhen it disappeared on 13 October.
OL,16,FThe body of crewmate Douglas Craigie,
OL,17,F49, was recovered from the sea in the
OL,18,Fearly hours of the following morning by
OL,19,Frescuers.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
