OL,3,GNEWSAItems recovered in search for
OL,4,Amissing fishing boat and crew
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, police confirmed that
OL,7,Fitems belonging to the vessel had been
OL,8,Frecovered from what was described as
OL,9,F"an area of interest" off the coast
OL,10,Fnear Port of Ness.
